{"name":"Zephyr","size":"medium","type":"Humanoid","tag":"Changeling","alignment":"LE","hitDice":"9","armorName":"mage armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":3,"otherArmorDesc":"12 (15 with _mage armor_)","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":true,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"120","speedDesc":"30 ft.","strPoints":"9","dexPoints":"16","conPoints":"11","intPoints":"15","wisPoints":"16","chaPoints":"20","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"15","customCr":"6 (2,300 XP)","customProf":3,"isLegendary":true,"legendariesDescription":"Zephyr can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. Zephyr regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the mage can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the mage can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The mage can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the mage's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the mage's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the mage dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Spellcasting","desc":"Zephyr is a 15th-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Charisma (spell save DC [CHA SAVE], [CHA ATK] to hit with spell attacks). Zephyr has the following Bard spells prepared:\n\n\n> * Cantrips (at will): \n> * 1st level (4 slots): \n> * 2nd level (3 slots): \n> * 3rd level (3 slots): \n> * 4th level (3 slots): \n> * 5th level (2 slots): \n> * 6th level (1 slot):\n> * 7th level (1 slot):\n> * 8th level (1 slot):"}],"actions":[],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"dex","order":1},{"name":"cha","order":5}],"skills":[{"name":"deception","stat":"cha","note":" (ex)"},{"name":"insight","stat":"wis"}],"damagetypes":[],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[],"languages":[{"name":"Abyssal","speaks":true},{"name":"Celestial","speaks":true},{"name":"Common","speaks":true},{"name":"Sylvan","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":0,"damage":[]}